* Modelos copiados de las bibliotecas estandar de LTspice 24 (lib/cmp/standard.dio y standard.bjt).
* Se copian aca para que los netlists corran solos (un .cir no carga esas bibliotecas).
* BAT41 (Schottky de 100 V en DO-35, el que se consigue en lugar del BAT46): modelo de Vishay, www.vishay.com/docs/85250/bat41.txt
* (subcircuito: 1 = anodo, 2 = catodo).
.model 1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=.4 tt=20n Iave=200m Vpk=75 mfg=OnSemi type=silicon)
.model QTLP690C D(Is=1e-22 Rs=6 N=1.5 Cjo=50p Xti=100 Iave=160m Vpk=5 mfg=Fairchild type=LED)
.model BC547B NPN(IS=2.39E-14 NF=1.008 ISE=3.545E-15 NE=1.541 BF=294.3 IKF=0.1357 VAF=63.2 NR=1.004 ISC=6.272E-14 NC=1.243 BR=7.946 IKR=0.1144 VAR=25.9 RB=1 IRB=1.00E-06 RBM=1 RE=0.4683 RC=0.85 XTB=0 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=1.358E-11 VJE=0.65 MJE=0.3279 TF=4.391E-10 XTF=120 VTF=2.643 ITF=0.7495 PTF=0 CJC=3.728E-12 VJC=0.3997 MJC=0.2955 XCJC=0.6193 TR=1.00E-32 CJS=0 VJS=0.75 MJS=0.333 FC=0.9579 Vceo=45 Icrating=100m mfg=NXP)

